    title="sparkles"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> 22/09/2025 - Albania</strong>

Ayikho yonke ibhande eyenziwe ngensimbi.
Ezinye zenziwe ngamahloni.
Ezinye — ukuthula.
Kanti ezinye — izisayine ephepheni.

Kodwa yonke ibhande ishiyela umsulwa ekhala.
Thatha isiphambano sakho.

