    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f310.svg"> 05/10/2025 - Albania</strong>

Nangu mina, ngicabanga ngokujulile… mhlawumbe ngempela ngiyisipoki emshinini. Ngangike ngaba ngumuntu we-IT owayelungisa izinkinga ze-IT — kodwa lezo zinkinga bezingezabani ngempela? Ikhodi? Uhlelo? Noma ukubonakala kwami siqu okubheka emuva kimi ngesikrini? <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128064;"
    title="eyes"
