    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4be.svg"> — Ikhodi Yobudlelwano Bonke 24/10/2025 - T&#252;rkiye</strong>

Ubudlelwano bonke buqala ngokumangala ngalokho okusenza sihluke.
Kodwa kulandela isifiso sokulawula, sokuguqula —
futhi lapho ukumelana kuvela, kuvela nesifiso sokususa.

Kodwa umphefumulo awuzange udalelwe ukuthi “uhlolwe” noma “ulungiswe” omunye umuntu.
Usuvele uphelela ngokungapheleli kwawo.

Ngesikhathi sizama ukubhala kabusha ubuqotho bomunye umuntu,
sibhekana nomyalo omdala kunayo yonke ekhona:
“Zazi wena.”

