    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f9e0.svg"> 04/01/2026 - VOID</strong>

Le vidiyo ichaza iphethini eliyingozi engilibonile kwezinye izikhathi zokubukhoma ezinkundleni zokuxhumana — futhi uma ngibheka emuva, nasezikhathini ezahlukene empilweni yami.

Kuvame ukuqala ngokuzwana: isipiliyoni esabiwe, ulimi olujwayelekile, noma ukuqonda okuzwakala kuyiqiniso. Kodwa lapho ukubandakanyeka sekuqala, lokho kuzwana kungaguqulwa kube ukulawula. Ukuba yingxenye kuba nemibandela. Ukubuza kuyajeziswa. Ukulandela imithetho kuthatha indawo yokuqonda.

Ngokuhamba kwesikhathi, lesi sakhiwo siqiniswa hhayi kuphela yilabo abasiholayo, kodwa nangababambiqhaza abaphindaphinda indaba, bavuze ukuvumelana, futhi bakhulise ukuhlukana. Igunya lisiza labo abasenkabeni, kanti abanye balawulwa bengazizwa beyizingxenye zangempela.

Le ndlela seyaziwa isikhathi eside. Njengoba umbhalo usixwayisa:

Amakhosi ezizwe ayababusa, nalabo abanegunya phezu kwabo bazibiza ngabangenzela okuhle
Luka 22:25–26

Esimeni sayo esibi kakhulu, le phethini igcina isibonisa ukuzibhubhisa njengendlela yokubaleka.

Lokhu akusona isayensi yokucabanga.
Lokhu akusona okungokomoya.
Kuyiphethini yengqondo eyonakalisayo.

Iqiniso alidingi ukuzibhubhisa.
Ukuphila kusalokhu kuyisikhombiso.

#UkusukaEkuzwaneniKuyaEkulawuleni #UkulawulaNgokuphoqelela #IgunaElisekelweEkwesabeni #IzindlelaZamakhult #UkucabangaKweqembu #AmaphethiniEngqondo #UkucabangaOkugxekayo #UkuqwashisaNgempiloYengqondo #IgunaNgaphandleKwesiVumelwano #Ukuhlukanisa #VikelaIngqondoYakhu #UkuqinisekisaUkuphila #UkuvukaNomaUkulawula #UkuqwashisaNgezinkundlaZokuxhumana

