Ukukhululeka kungasetshenziswa ukududuza — noma ukulawula.
Lokhu kuzindla kuhlola ukuthi ukwesaba, izinhlelo, nokuzethemba okungamanga kugcina abantu belalela, nokuthi yini esala lapho inkohliso isibhidlika.
Angiphikisani nezinhla noma nginikeze izimpendulo — ngibuka kuphela lokho okuvezekayo lapho ukukhululeka kungasekho iphuzu lokubhekisela.

