Ukuzindla nge–spoken word okukhuluma ngokholo, inkohliso, nokuManje okuphakade.
Akukhulunywa ngokufakazela ukuthi uNkulunkulu ukhona — kukhulunywa ngokukhumbula ukuthi wena uyibo ubufakazi.
Indaba iyasindisa ngoba uMoya okuyo uyaqhubeka nokuphila, uphefumula kubo bonke abaphila isifundo kunokuphikisana ngesimo.

