    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3ad.svg"> 08/10/2025 - Albania</strong>

Ingabe kuyisiprofetho — umbono walokho okuzayo —
noma ukumkhumbula nje okwamanje okuphakade okugqoke isifihla-buso esisha?
Ngezinye izikhathi, okuzwakala njengembulo kuyisikhathi samanje nje esisikhumbuza ukuthi besihlale sikhona.

