<code class="chatlog__markdown-pre chatlog__markdown-pre--multiline nohighlight"> 
# &#128190; Uhlelo: Ukubonisa Uthando Ezweni Lami 26/09/2025 - Albania

# I-variable egcinelwe ukwabiwa okuguqukayo
uthando = None

# Hlonipha konke engiyikho lapho ukwaba
uthando = &quot;ukuzihlonipha + iqiniso + inkululeko&quot;

# Iphutha elivamile (ungakwenzi lokhu):
# uthando = &quot;ukulawula&quot;  # ❌ kubonisa ukuboshwa, hhayi uthando

# Umsebenzi owenza uthando lusebenze endaweni yami
def bonisa_uthando(uthando):
    if uthando == &quot;ukulawula&quot;:
        return &quot;Iphutha: ukuphambuka kutholakele. Umsebenzi awusebenzi ngenhloso efanele.&quot;
    else:
        return f&quot;Uthando lwenziwe njenge {uthando} — luhlanzekile, lukhululekile, futhi luhambisana.&quot;

# Qalisa uhlelo
print(bonisa_uthando(uthando))

#CodeOfLove #DynamicAssignment #LoveNotControl #FreedomFunction #SelfRespect #InnerCode #SpiritualCoding #BreakTheLoop #TruthCompiler #SovereigntyScript #LifeAsCode #ProgrammedForFreedom</code>
