Uma umthetho ungagxilile ekulungeni kukaNkulunkulu, ungaba kanjani isisekelo sangempela seBandla? IBandla lombuso alisoze lama — liboshwe yinkohlakalo, liyawa njengendlu eyakhiwe phezu kwesihlabathi. Kodwa uKristu uyasikhumbuza:
“Ngokuba lapho ababili noma abathathu bebuthene egameni lami, ngikhona phakathi kwabo” (Mathewu 18:20).
IBandla aligciniwe ezikhungweni; liphila noma yikuphi lapho abakholwayo behlangana egameni Lakhe.

