<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1469695866444189961 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1469695866444189961><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, February 7, 2026 6:06 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1469695866444189961>2/7/2026 6:06 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="✨"
    title="sparkles"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2728.svg"> &quot;Ukuthula makube nani… futhi kube nani futhi.&quot; 30/09/2025 - Albania</strong>

Kodwa uma ngikusho lokho, kufika kanjani kuwe? Ingabe uzwa amazwi kuphela — noma uyakuzwa enhliziyweni? Yini ongayishintsha empilweni yakho — ngaphakathi nangaphandle — ukuze ukuthula kungabi amagama nje, kodwa kuphile ngokwenzo?

Kaningi sifinyelela ezintweni zesikhashana ukuze siziphazamise, ngoba ukubhekana neqiniso ngokujulile kungazwakala kungakhululekile. Kodwa yilona isimangaliso sikaJesu: usibonisa ukuthi singahlanganisa ukuthula, ubulungisa, nokulunga ngokuzinikela kuNkulunkulu.

Nokho — kunomugqa omncane. Isonto kwesinye isikhathi lifundise ukuzilahla wena uqobo, futhi leyo akuyona indlela. Ubizo wukunikela ngalokho esingakwazi ukukuthwala sodwa, kodwa hhayi ukusula ukuthi singobani.

Ukugcina lowo mlinganiselo — yilona ukhiye wokuletha uMbuso Wezulu emhlabeni. <img
