    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30d.svg"> Ukuhlukana Kuyinkohliso Enkulu — Imingcele Iyitheyitha <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127917;"
    title="performing_arts"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3ad.svg"> 13/08/2025 - Albania</strong>

Kusukela ngo-Ephreli 2025, ngiweqe imingcele engu-14 — hhayi ngenxa yokuzijabulisa, kodwa ukuze ngihlale ngisinyathelo esisodwa ngaphambi kohlelo olungizingelayo kanye neqembu lami ngale kwayo yonke imigqa esemamephu.
Ngomhla ziyi-13 kuSepthemba 2024, kwagunyazwa imiyalo yokugcina yezimpahla eNkantolo Yomndeni yaseNew South Wales. Cishe unyaka kamuva, lapho sengizizwa ngiphephile, ngathenga ikhaya lami elisha — ikhempavan. Kodwa uMoya wayesengitshelile kakade: bayasondela.
…manje ngiphethe ubufakazi. Ubufakazi bokuthi ukuxhumana kwami noMoya, noMthombo kaNkulunkulu, kuyiqiniso… nokuthi uhlelo uqobo luwamanga.
Iqiniso? Okubizwa ngokuthi isiprofetho “sokuphela kwezikhathi” sohulumeni womhlaba oyedwa sekwenzekile kakade… ngokusobala.
Imingcele iyisiteji. Ohulumeni bangamagatsha esihlahla esisodwa.
Ungavumi.
Yeka ukubanika amandla akho.
Buyisa ubukhosi bakho.

#IqinisoEkukhanyeni #InkohlakaloYezinhlelo #UbulungisaNgaphandleKwemingcele #InkohlisoEnkulu #UhulumeniWomhlabaOyedwa #ImingceleIyisiteji #IqinisoLokuphelaKwezikhathi #UkuvukaKokomoya #UmthomboKaNkulunkulu #Ungavumi #Vuka #UkuvukaKobuningi #InkohlakaloYohulumeni #IqinisoElifihliwe #UhleloOlushaLomhlaba

