Umphakathi usifundisa “ibhokisi” — imingcele, ukuvalelwa, nobunini — bese ukukubiza ngokuthi impumelelo. Kodwa ibhokisi lidla ugqozi, hhayi umoya. UNkulunkulu akakwazi ukufakwa ebhokisini; ukuzama ukwenza lokho kuwukumboza ngophawu lokho esicabanga ukuthi siyakuqonda.
Eqinisweni, siqala ophawini bese siyehla singene emthonjeni — kujule empilweni, enkolweni, nasolwazini — lapho incazelo iphuphuma khona ingapheli.

#AkusikhoIbhokisi #UmthomboUwuhambo #UkushintshaKombono #UgqoziNeMoya #UjuleOlufihlekile #BukaUsondele #UhamboLwangaphakathi

