<img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128226;"
    title="loudspeaker"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4e2.svg"> Ngishicilela wonke amadokhumenti enkantolo ahlobene nodaba lwami lomthetho womndeni.

Ayatholakala ngesiteshi sami se-Discord, esixhunywe ku-Patreon yami, kanye nobufakazi bami obugcwele bemizuzu engu-50 obunesihloko esithi &quot;I-Narcissism Iyisistimu&quot;.

Ngemuva kwesikhathi esingaphezu konyaka ngaphakathi kohlelo lomthetho womndeni, isipiliyoni sami sikhuphule ukukhathazeka okukhulu mayelana nokusobala, ukuphendula, kanye nenqubo efanele yomthetho. Ngikholwa ukuthi umphakathi ufanele ukubona — hhayi ukufihlwa.

Wonke amadokhumenti ayabiwe ukuze abantu bakwazi ukubuyekeza ulwazi ngokwabo futhi benze iziphetho zabo.

<img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128204;"
    title="pushpin"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4cc.svg"> Sicela uqaphele: ngaphakathi kwe-Discord, umlayezo ofakwe phezulu ubhekisa kurekhodi lommeli wezingane eliqinisekisa umhlangano nezingane zami ngomhlaka 15 Septhemba 2025 eNewcastle.

Lokhu kumayelana nokubhalwa kwamarekhodi, ukusobala, kanye nokuqinisekisa ukuthi amarekhodi ayatholakala.

Iqiniso alikwesabi ukukhanya kwelanga.

