Enye yezinkumbulo engizithandayo namadodana ami — ngemva kosuku esiluchithe siphumile, ngangifika ekhaya ngifake imoto emgwaqweni wokungena, ngibheke esihlalweni sangemuva futhi ngibathole “belele”.
Empeleni babefuna nje ukuthi ngibaphathe ngibangene nabo endlini… futhi lokho kwakungangihluphi, ngoba ngangihlala ngithola nokungigona.

