    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128239;"
    title="postal_horn"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4ef.svg"> 07/03/2026 - VOID</strong>

Ezinye izingoma zithinta ngendlela ehlukile. Ezinye sizizwa ngokushesha, kanti ezinye sifunda ukuzithanda lapho ukuvumelana kufika. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127744;"
    title="cyclone"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f300.svg">

Ukukwazi ukubona ingoma yonke kusukela ekuqaleni kuze kube sekugcineni kuyisibusiso. Njengengxenye ephindaphindwayo yengoma oyithandayo ongakwazi ukuyeka ukuyihamisa, ungabuyela njalo kulolo jabulo ngenqubo emnandi kodwa ebuhlungu kancane esiyibiza ngokuthi ukukhumbula. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127925;"
    title="musical_note"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f3b5.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128171;"
    title="dizzy"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f4ab.svg">

Futhi khumbula: uma sekuba nzima kakhulu, ungaba nokuthula ngokudedela indima yenaliti — uyeke ukulawula futhi uzicabange uyimbali. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127800;"
    title="cherry_blossom"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f338.svg"> Ngaleso sikhathi umculo awusakuchazi, futhi ukuthula kuqhakaza ngaphakathi kwakho ngokwemvelo.

UMathewu 6:28–30 usikhumbuza: izimbali zasensimini azisebenzi futhi aziphothi, kodwa zigqokiswe ngobuhle.

Futhi uma sibheka kancane ngendlela yesayensi — “kungani” yilokho okubalulekile, kusukela egagasini kuya esimisweni. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127754;"
    title="ocean"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30a.svg">

Uma ukhathele futhi udinga ukuphumula, yima isikhashana ukubuza “kungani”… futhi vele ube khona. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128156;"
    title="purple_heart"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f49c.svg">

