    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128293;"
    title="fire"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f525.svg"> 04/03/2026 - VOID</strong>

Ake ngikucacise lokhu.

Uma umuntu enza umonakalo ngamabomu futhi enenhloso — bese ezama ukudlulisela imiphumela ye-karma komunye umuntu — lokho akusona i-karma. Lokho ukuhlukumeza.

Ngakhuluma. Ngaxwayisa abantu. Ngahlinzeka ubufakazi. Lapho sekungaphephile, ngahoxa. Ukuthuliswa noma i-gaslighting akusho ukuthi umuntu uyavuma.

Futhi ngifuna lokhu kushiwo ngokucacile: Angivumi kunoma yiluphi uhlelo olucatshangelwayo lokuzalwa kabusha (reincarnation loop) oluhloselwe ukucubungula i-karma yomunye umuntu ngenxa yezono ezenziwe ngamabomu. Akekho okufanele aphoqwe ukuthwala imiphumela yezono angazenzanga.

I-karma ingeyomuntu oyidalayo. Iqiniso lihlala libuyela emthonjeni walo. <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
    title="dove"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f54a.svg">

