<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1513496700340146247 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1513496700340146247><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Monday, June 8, 2026 2:55 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1513496700340146247>6/8/2026 2:55 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong>UMTHETHO NAMANDLA — Yini Oyisekelayo? <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="⚖️"
    title="scales"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/2696.svg"><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128267;"
    title="battery"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f50b.svg"> 16/05/2026 - VOID</strong>

Umthetho awuyona nje imithetho — uyisakhiwo.
Futhi isakhiwo ngasinye sidinga amandla ukuze sibe khona.

Umbuzo awukhona ukuthi amandla akhona yini…

Yindlela atholakala ngayo.

Uma amandla ethathwa, isakhiwo siyaphambuka.

Uma amandla enikezwa, isakhiwo siyahambisana.

Ikhaya lakho, indawo yakho, ubudlelwano bakho —
zonke ziyizindawo zokuhlala.

Hhayi nje izikhala ezibonakalayo, kodwa neziqukathi zamandla.

Ngakho umbuzo wangempela uba:
Hlobo luni lwamandla ohlala kulo… futhi olusekelayo?

#Amandla #Ingokomoya #Ukuqwashisa #Iqiniso #Ukuqwashisa #Umthetho #Ingqondo #Ukuqwashisa #Umbono #Idolobha #I-fyp #foryou

